<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Piyɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Piyɛlɛ Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Piyɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Piyɛlɛ Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Keelai Piyɛlɛ ɠa é Piyɛlɛ Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi nii zɛʋɛai. Piyɛlɛ tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ, ta é naama nuiti ta-vai zuɠula, niiti sɛʋɛi leʋegai ti ma. Sɛʋɛi nii leʋeni Keletiɛinti pɛ ma, é ti-laasei pɛai ga wɛɛinti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:1">1:1</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:11">2:11</ref></char>). É ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ɠana, siɛ mɔinmɔin su naama nuiti pɔ, niiti ná-sɛʋɛi leʋegai ti ma, tɔɔzei naati fazaga ɠɛni de zou mɔinmɔin su. Ʋelei sɛʋɛi nii ɠulaai la kɛʋelei tanigaani su, ga Pɔle nɔnɔi teʋegai Efɛze nuiti ma, nu mɔinmɔin ka ɠisiɛzu ga Piyɛlɛ ná-sɛʋɛ mɔungi nii zɛʋɛni Efɛze nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ʋoluma, tanisu kona ʋuulɔzita maazu lɔɔlugɔi (65) ma ziɛgi zu, Kilista zɔlɔɔgai ʋoluma. Piyɛlɛ sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni Wɔlɔme, ʋɛ é ná laasei pɛɛzu Ɓaɓilɔne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">5:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Piyɛlɛ ɠɛ é niima zɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ, nii a kɛ é wo lɛnɛ, é maaɓakpa, ga pele ɠana GALA ná-zaala ɠitei la, nii wo ɠiliai ba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:12">5:12</ref></char>). Kulagaʋei wola mɔinʋɛ 1 Piyɛlɛ 2:11—3:7 ti zɔɠɔzu, ta Efɛze 5:18—6:9, naa ʋɛɛ Kolɔse 3:18—4:6 ʋa. Naama ada saʋagɔiti pɛ ta kalagi veezu, é lo pɛlɛyeɠe wu vaiti ba ta koloi kundiɠiiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Piyɛlɛ ɠa ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu, ta é ɓɔɛ ná-sɛʋɛi ɠala nuiti pɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋolu Piyɛlɛ ɠa GALA mamasu kizogi vaa zu, nii ɛsɛ pɛ ka zoo nɔnɔ zɔlɔɔsu su, é naa ʋoluʋɛ zuɠula ti ma, é lo ta-eteai ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-2:10">1:3—2:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Naa ʋoluma mɔnɔ é kidaaleʋe nuiti kala ga ʋelei ti maanɛai la ti ziɛ la ga pagɔ eteai zu, é zɛba é ɠaaʋote gaazaɠagi ma, nii pilɛgai zinigiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ʋa ta anzaiti, duɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ʋa ta duɔ kɛɛɠɛiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:11">2:11—4:11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Naa ɓegai ma, Piyɛlɛ ti iɲɔdɔɔni ga ti yiilɔɔ kpɔlɔi wu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 4:12-5:11">4:12—5:11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Naa pɛ poluma, é ná-sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓela (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Piyɛlɛ, gè ga Yesu Kilista ná-keelai, nà ɠa gè sɛʋɛi nii leʋesu GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti wo ma, wɔi é yiimazeɠeai ga woye, wo ga wɛɛinti wo vazagai Pɔn ta Galate yooi zu, naa ʋɛɛ Kapadɔse, ta Azi, ta Ɓitini yooiti su ʋa, <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA ge yiimazeɠeni ga woye ma yeeluɠɔ, eɠɛʋelei ná-faazeikpasui la, ná-Zɛnvui zaalai zu, nii é wo ɲadesu ga wo ɠolo Yesu Kilista ʋɛ, wo gba, wo ɠole ga ma ɲamai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Zaalai ta ziilɛigi ɠɛ wo ma ga gola.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kizogi ma ɠitogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Mamagi ɠa de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista Kɛɛɠɛ GALA bɛ! Ná-gaazumaawɔinɠaa wolai zu, é zɛnvu niinɛi veeni ade ʋɛ, ga Yesu Kilista wuzeɠe vai, é ɠula saai ya. Naa ɠa é de ya ga kitogi nii é vulua. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Pogani ʋe, é la zooga é ʋa luula, ɓaa é ʋa ɠɔzɔ, ná-pagi la ɠulaa ba. Poganii naa makɛgɛ wo ʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>wɔiti é wo makɛsu GALA ná-zɛbɛi zu, kidaaleʋei zaɓui zu, kizogi vaa ma, kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga é ɠula kɛlɛma yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagiti su.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Wa ɠoozunɛɛzu naa zu, anɛɛ ni kɛɛɠeleɠele ge la ná niizu, wo yiiɓɔlɔ yeeɠɛɠala go laawu, ga suɠɔɠɔgi ma ziiti. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Naa ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga wa-ɠidaaleʋei zuɠɔɠɔgai. Zanugi é ɠoloɠolosu, anɛɛ naa ʋe, su ɠa ɗa ɠɔɠɔ abui ɠa. Zekana é la ga wa-ɠidaaleʋei, nii gola vizɔgai zanugi ʋa, toɠa ɗa lɔ suɠɔɠɔgi zu, naa ɠa a kɛ ná-zɛbɛi ɠwɛɛ. Naazu wa maamusɛi ta lɛbiyai ta bɔɔlɔi zɔlɔɔ, siɛgi zu Yesu Kilista ɠulazu la kɛlɛma. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Wo nɛɛʋɛ ʋɛ, anɛɛ ni wo la ɠɛni kaani. Wa ɠidaaleʋezu ma, anɛɛ ni wo la dɛ kaani niizu. Wa ɠɔkɔsu ga koozunɛɛi nii maawuiɗai, ta nu la zooga suɠulazu, <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>mazɔlɔɔ wo wa-ɠidaaleʋei ma ungi zɔlɔɔga, wo-yɛnvuiti kizo fai.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>GALA goo wo nuiti niiti ti zaalai naa ma vaa woni ma yeeluɠɔ nii GALA ge ʋaazu feezu wo ʋɛ, ti kizo fai nii lɔɔɓɛɛni, ti fɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Ti ɠaaɓaani ga ti yeeɠɛɠalaiti ta ti zu vaiti kwɛɛ, é ʋilɛ naama vaiti ba, Kilista ná-Zɛnvui dɛɛzu, mazɔlɔɔ Zɛnvui naa, nii é ɠɛni ti-yiimaʋɛ, é ɠɛni Kilista ná-kpɔlɔ vaiti bosu ma yeeluɠɔ, ta lɛbiyai é ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu naa ʋolu. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>GALA ge dɛɛni ga GALA goo wo nuiti ga keela wooi é veeni ti ya, é la ɠɛni ga tiya ɓɔɠɔi tɔnɔ, kɛlɛ wa ɠa wɔnɔ ɠɛni de. Keela wooi naa laazeelini wo ma niina Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma lɛnɛbo nuiti zea, niiti ti ma ɓɔɛi woni, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɛbɛi zu nii teʋegai, é zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Geezuɠeelaiti ɓɔɠɔi wɔin ɠɛni ti ma ga ti kwɛɛ.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wo loligɛ ga wo eteai ziɛ <optbreak/> ɲadedai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à wo-ɠigi makɛ, wo ɠɛ ga sɔɓelama nuiti, wa-ɠitogi pɛ ge lo zaalai ʋa, é ʋaazu veezu wo ya, siɛgi zu Yesu Kilista ɠulazu la kɛlɛma. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>À ɠɛ ga kolo lointi. À mina ʋilɛ kisiɛiti polu, ti ɠɛni wo-yiimaʋɛ wɔlɔwɔlɔi, siɛgi zu wo ɠɛni la ga faaɠwɛtala nuiti. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Kɛlɛ à ɲade wo ziɛ ʋelei pɛ su, eɠɛʋelei GALA nii é wo loligai, naa ɲadegai la. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Tɔɔzei sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «À ɲade, mazɔlɔɔ ɲàdegɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19:2</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eteai ziɛ GALA gaazuluabai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Wa-ƓALA falii zu, wa naa lolisu ga Ɠɛɛɠɛ, nii é tukpɔɠaaleʋezu ga sɔledai, é zoloo nui ɠilagilagi ná-kɛɛwotiiti ma. Naa ma, yeeɠɛɠalai kpein é wo ya ga wo kɛ eteai zu, à dɛɛ wo luʋa ʋelei zu ga wa ziɛzu ga GALA gaazuluabai. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Eteai ziɛ ʋelei nii wo-mɛmɛwolani ti zɛni wo ya, naa la ɓena faa nɔpɛ paa nu ma. Kɛlɛ wo suɠwɛɛni ga GALA ge wo ɠeyaʋɛ ga sɔngɔ wola, nii a kɛ é wo unmɔɔ naama etea ziɛgi ma, mazɔlɔɔ é la kɛɛni ga aniiti ta zoo ɠoloɠolosu, eɠɛʋelei walii la, ɓaa zanugi. <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>Kɛlɛ wo unmɔɔni ga Kilista ma ɲama vizɔgai maaʋele, nii é ɠɛni eɠɛ baala ziʋoi, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, kɔzɔzu la ba. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Ziimazeɠegi woni da, aisa eteai ʋa ɓɛtɛ. É ɠulani kɛlɛma yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagi nii zu, wa-vaa zu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Tɔun maaʋele ma, wo ɠidaaleʋea GALA ma, nii é buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, é lɛbiyai ve bɛ. Naa ma, wa-ɠidaaleʋei ta wa-ɠitogi ta GALA ba.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Wo ɓega ʋoluma ga ɠolo gaamai ʋɛ, wo ɓɔɠɔ ɲadega ga, wo wo-ɠɛɛleaiti nɛɛ ʋɛ ga nɛɛbɛi nii wooveleda la su. À ɓɔɠɔ nɛɛ ʋɛ mu wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ga wo-yiimaʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo zɔlɔɔgɛ ʋolu ga niinɛ, naa la ɠɛɛni ga wo-ɠɛɛni saɓu ti zaazu, naati taade, kɛlɛ ga ani zuwui zaala, nii é la zaazu, naa ɠa é ga GALA daawooi, nii é vulua, é yɛsu ná ɠɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">«Nuɓusɛi pɛ kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ tufai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">ná-lɛbiyai ɠɛ eɠɛ tufai ma ʋuai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Tufai ɠa ɗa vɔ, ma ʋuai ʋoolo,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>kɛlɛ Maliɠii laawooi ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Eza 40:6-8</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Tama naama wooi ɠa ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi, daazeeliai wo ma.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔtui é vulua, ta nuɓusɛ ɲadegaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à keleɠele ɲɔi ma zii pɛ too ya, ta yaava vai ma zii pɛ, ta wooveledai, ta tolo ɲɔi, ta tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo faiti pɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>À ɠɛ eɠɛ doun zɔlɔɔga niinɛiti, zɛnvu zu ɲiimiɗɛ ɠitei wɔin wo zo, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo wɔɔlɔ kizogi vaa zu ga tɔun maaʋele, <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>tɔɔzei wo pɛtɛga ʋelei Maliɠii ʋagai la.<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>À maaɓuɠa Maliɠii ʋa, kɔtui é vulua, nuiti ti ɠɛlɛni ba, kɛlɛ GALA ge yiimazeɠeni la, é deve ga fizɔgɛ gola gaazu. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>À maaɓuɠa ba, wa ɓalaa, eɠɛ kɔtuiti ti vulua, é wo lo ga zɛnvu zu ʋɛlɛi, wo lo zalaɠa ɠulazu losu ɲadegai, ga wo ɗa zɛnvu zu zalaɠaiti kula, ti nɛai GALA bɛ, Yesu Kilista maaʋele ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ bogɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">«Wɛlɛ, nà kɔtu laazu Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai ɠɛ de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">ziimazeɠegi wogɛ da, fizɔgɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">zɔi a ɠidaaleʋe ma, é la unfega.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Eza 28:16</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Kɔtui tɛi tosuʋɛ wɔɔlɔʋɛ wo ʋɛ, wɔi wo ɠidaaleʋea, kɛlɛ kidaaleʋelala nuiti tetema:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">«Kɔtui nii pɛlɛ lo nuiti ti ɠɛlɛni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">naa ɠa kɛai ga sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai,»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Guy 118:22</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>ta:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">«kɔtui nii nu ɠɔɠɔ ɠa ziɠa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">fasai nu ɠa ɓunɛ ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Eza 8:14</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ta ɠɔɠɔi ziɠazu ba, tɔɔzei ta ɠɛlɛzu ga ti mina ɠolo wooi ʋɛ, naa ma ka é leveni ti ma.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ga zii ziimazeɠegi wogai da, Masagi ná-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, zii ɲadegai, GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti. Wa ɠa GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga woye, naa ɠa a kɛ wo ɗa ná-faa ʋagɔiti bo, nii é wo lolini, wo zeɠe kpidii zu, wo ʋa ná-wozakala pagɔi ɠa. <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Mɔungi zu, wo la ɠɛni ga GALA ná-nuɓusɛa, kɛlɛ niizu wa niina ga ná-nuɓusɛiti. Mɔungi zu, wo la ɠɛni GALA ná-maawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔni, kɛlɛ niizu wo maawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuʋa ʋele ʋagɔi <optbreak/> kidaaleʋelala nuiti saama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, nà wo lɛnɛsu, tɔɔzei wa ga teʋekɔɠɔzu wɛɛinti eteai zu, à ɓeteʋe ɓɔɠɔyiimaiti ba ti ɲɛpii ɠɔɔzu wo-yɛnvui laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>À wo-ziɛ ʋelei ɓɛtɛ kidaaleʋelala nuiti saama, anɛɛ ni ta wo levezu ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu, kɛɛɠeleɠele ge la ná, ta wa-ɠɛɛwoti ʋagɔiti ka, ta lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ, voloi é ʋaazu la.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Maliɠii maaʋele ma, à ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuɓusɛiti ta-zobogi pɛ bɛ. À kɛ masagi ʋɛ, tɔ ɠa é devei unda, <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>wo kɛ zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti bɛ, tiya ɠa ti leʋegai ga ti faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti maaɠolo, ti faa ʋagɔ ɠɛ nuiti maamusɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ziimai ɠa ga wo ɠimalala nuiti ta faaɠwɛtala nuiti daaɠulu ga faa ʋagɔi wo kɛɛzu. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>À ziɛ é zoloo wɔɔlɔ ziɛi ma. Kɛlɛ à mina wa-wɔɔlɔyai ɠɛ ga faa ɲɔi maalɔɔɠu zeɠei. À ziɛ eɠɛ GALA ná-botiɠɛ nuiti. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>À unfe nui pɛ ma. À wo-ɠɛɛleaiti nɛɛ ʋɛ. À lua GALA ba. À unfe masagi ma.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ná-kpɔlɔi ʋaaɠulabaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Botiɠɛ nuiti, à ɓɔɠɔmaayei wo-maliɠiiti bɛ ga unfemai pɛ, é la nɔ ga niiti ta-vai ɠaanɛai, ti-zɔgi ʋagai, kɛlɛ anɛɛ niiti ta-vai ɓaai, naati ɓalaa. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga faa ʋagɔi, ni kpɔlɔi a zeina nu ma kazemazu, nu ɠolo vai zu GALA bɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Naama lɔnɔgi ɠa ga leeni, wo yiilɔɔ, ti wo zopele ɲɔu, tɔɔzei wa-ɠotoi ʋa? Kɛlɛ ni wa yiilɔɔ, wo kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔ, wo faa ʋagɔi ɠɛa ʋoluma, naa ɠa ga faa ʋagɔi GALA gaazu. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Tama naa ɠa wo loligai ma, tɔɔzei Kilista ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa ɓɔlɔni wo ʋɛ, é poo pagɔi yɛ wo ya, ga wo ʋilɛ kɔɠɔ ʋogiti ba. <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>É la ɠɛni koto nɔpɛ kɛɛni, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni zɛɛ ɓɔɛ mɛnini, é ʋa ɠula daaʋɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>É la ɠɛni poomu salani ga poomugi. Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni maanɔɠɔzu la, é la ɠɛni kpaazaɠa nɔpɛ bosu, kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ná-fai pɛ zɛsu GALA zeezu, nii é tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu ga telebodai. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Kilista ɓɔɠɔi da-ɠotoiti seɠeni kpusɛi zu saa wului ma, naa ɠa a kɛ, de zaa da-ɠotoiti ma, de zɛnvui wo telebodai ʋɛ. Tɔun ka ná-maawana ʋala ʋiliiti ti wo ɠɛdɛni. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo ɠɛni eɠɛ baalagiti ti loai ya, kɛlɛ niizu wo ɠalega ma baala makɛ nui ʋɔ bɛ, é ga wo-yɛnvuiti makɛ nui.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Anzaiti ta ti-zinigiti ti ɠɛʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Anzaiti, wa ɓalaagi, à ɓɔɠɔmaayei wo-zinigiti bɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ, ni tanigaani ta ná, ti la kɛɛzu ti ʋa la GALA daawooi la, naati ti ɠidaaleʋe ga ti-anzaiti siɛ ʋelei maaʋele, kpɔɛzuɠula nɔpɛ ge la ba, <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>ta wo-ziɛ ʋele ɲadegai ɠaana, unfemai zu. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Wa-ʋadai un ge mina zei wo-ɓusɛi maaʋɛ nɔ ʋa: unfɛlɛ laalitaaligiti, zanu maaɠili zɔɔlaiti, ta seɠe wola ʋagɔiti. <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Kɛlɛ wa-ʋadai ɠɛ ga nii dɔɔɠuai wo-yiimaʋɛ, padai é la luulaa, é zɔlɔɔsu ziilɛi zɛnvui zu, gaanɛai, naa ɠa sɔngɔi ɓaɠoai GALA gaazu. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Zekana mɔungi anzanu ɲadegaiti ti ɓena ɓɔɠɔ ɓɛtɛ la, tɛiti ti-ɠigi loni GALA ba, ti ɓɔɠɔmaayeini ti-zinigiti bɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Eɠɛʋelei Sala ɠɛni la, é ɓɔɠɔmaayeini Abalaame ʋɛ, é ɗa toli ga «màliɠii». Niizu wo ɠɛa ga naa, ná-anzanu lointi, ni wa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛzu, wo la ɓɔɠɔ yɛsu ná, wo ʋa ɓɔlɔ ga maalua vaa nɔpɛ.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Anzazinigiti, wa ɓalaagi, à eteai ziɛ ʋɔɔma, wa wo-anzaiti, wo ɠizɛ ta-zɛbɛsulala vai zu. À unfe ti ma, tɔɔzei wa tiyani wa zɛnvui ma ʋoganii zeɠezu ʋɔɔma, nii GALA ge feezu ná-zaalai zu, naa ɠa a kɛ faa tanɔpɛ ge mina wa-ƓALA falii zuɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋe nui ziɛ ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Gaaɓelagi ɠa ga: Kisiɛ ɠilagi ɠɛ wo pɛ wo-yiimaʋɛ, ta wo ɗa yeezei ɓɔɠɔ wu wa-ɓalaiti su. Wo-yiimaʋɛ laave ga ɠɛɛɠɛloun nɛɛbɛi, ta maawɔinɠai, ta ɓɔɠɔmaayeii. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>À mina faa ɲɔi zala ga faa ɲɔi, ɓaa poomugi ga poomugi. Kɛlɛ tɔun, à tuya loo, mazɔlɔɔ naa ɠa wo loligai ma, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo tuyai zɔlɔɔ, nii GALA ge makɛgai wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">«Zɔi é wɔinni ga zɛnvui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">é undaanɛ voloiti sɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">é nɛgi makɛ, é mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">dakɔlɔgiti ti mina yaava ɓɔɛ wo.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>É ʋoluave faa ɲɔi ʋa, é faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">é ziilɛigi ɠaiziɛ, é ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii ɠaazuʋɛ ɠa telebo nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">goilogɛ ta-ƓALA fali wooiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa ɠaazuʋɛ lati naati daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:13-17">Guy 34:13-17</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ga woye, ni wa zɛbɛzeɠezu faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛ vai zu? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun, ni wa kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔsu tɔɔzei wa telebo fai ɠɛɛzu, undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye! À mina dua nɔpɛ bo nuiti ba naazu, wo-yii mina ɓɔlɔ pa. <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun, à Kilista lɛbi wo-yiimaʋɛ, tɔ ɠa é ga wo-Maliɠii. Wo ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ɠɛ de yeenɔpɛ, wo naati pɛ gooɠaaʋote, zɔiti ti wo ɠaazaɠasu wa-ɠitogi ma ungi ma. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Kɛlɛ à naa ɠɛ ga sɛsɛbogi ta unfemai. Wa-ɠisiɛi ɲade, naa ɠa a kɛ siɛgi zu ti wo ʋeelalazu la, zɔiti ti woo ɲɔi wosu wo-ziɛ ʋele ʋagɔi laalɔɠɔma, nii soloogai Kilista nɔnɔiti ma, ti unfe ga ti-laawooiti. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Fizɔgɛ nu maanɔɠɔ faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai zu, ni naa ɠa é ga GALA ziimai, kɛlɛ è maa mina nɔɠɔ faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛ vai zu.<verse eid="1PE 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Tama, Kilista ɓɔɠɔi zaani nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti faa zu, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, tɔungi é ga telebo nui, é naa ɠɛ telebotala nuiti ta-vaa zu, naa ɠa a kɛ é ʋa ga woye GALA pɔ. Kpusɛi zaani, kɛlɛ é zɛnvui zɔlɔɔni ʋolu, é vulu su, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zaɓui zu. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Naama Yɛnvui zɛbɛi zu, é liini é GALA daawooi laazeeli zɛnvuiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni kasoi ɠa, <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>naati ti-yɛnvuiti ma, niiti ti kololalai ɠɛɛni wɔlɔwɔlɔi zu ga GALA. Naama voloiti su ɠa GALA ge ɠɛni maaɓɔungi wosu da ga ziilɔɔi, siɛgi zu Nowe ɠɛni keingi ɓɛtɛzu la. Nuiti ti la ɠɛni mɔinni, ti ɠɛni lɔsaʋa nɔ, niiti ti lɛɛni ɓatoi naa zu, GALA ti ɠizoni ga ziɛi maaʋele. <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Ziɛi naa ɠa ga ɓatizei ma ʋoogi, é wo ɠizosu niizu. Tɔ laade é ʋa ɠɛ kpusɛi ná-kɔzɔba vaiti gbazu, kɛlɛ GALA fali wooi ʋe, daazeelizu GALA ma ga kisiɛ ʋagɔi. Toɠa wo ɠizosu ga Yesu Kilista wuzeɠe vai zu, é ɠula saai ya, <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>nii diai geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é zeini GALA zeezazuʋɛ, ʋɛ é masadai ɠɛɛzu ná geezuɠeelaiti ta zɛnvuiti unda niiti zobogiti ti ti ya, naa ʋɛɛ zɛbɛiti ba.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s">Nui ziɛ ʋeleiti ti maavalibogai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tɔɔzei Kilista ɓɔlɔni kpusɛi zu, wa ɓalaagi à ɓɔɠɔ zɛbɛlɔ naama ɠisiɛi zu, mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔgai kpusɛi zu, naa ɓeteʋea kotoi ʋa, <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina mɔ eteai ziɛ ɓɔɠɔyiimai zu, kɛlɛ kɛni wo zɛnvui wo ga GALA ziimai, yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ daawu é wo ya eteai zu. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Naa kula ɠɛ, nii wo ziaa su mɔungi, nii é ɠɛni ga GALA kwɛɛtala nuiti ziima vaiti, wo ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ve ɓaaɠulama vaiti zea, ta gaazuɠulapɔ ɲɔiti, ta dɔɔzodaiti, ta ziimaɠɛɛ lateʋegai, ta ani ɓɔle vaiti, ta kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vaa ɲɔiti ma. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Ti laa ɠa niina vɔɔzu niizu, ga wo la mɔ ʋilɛsu ti ʋolu tuʋa ʋele ɲɔi naati su, ta niina wo-lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolosu. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Kɛlɛ ta ʋoluvaawo naa ma, zɔi kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga é nu vuluiti ta gɔvɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni deɠɛmu Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini la gɔvɛiti ma, naa ɠa a kɛ nuiti kpega ʋoluma ga ti lukpɔɠaaleʋe ti-ɓusɛi zu, ti zɛnvui wo eɠɛʋelei GALA ziimai la ti-yɛnvui letegi zu.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">À ɓɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa wo ɠilagilagi pɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Anii pɛ kpe foloi maaɓuɠaa. À ɠɛ mu ga ɠima nuiti, ta kidafaawu nuiti, nii a kɛ wo ɓɔɠɔ ve Gala falii ya. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Fai pɛ su, à ɓɔɠɔ nɛɛ ʋɛ gola, mazɔlɔɔ nɛɛbɛi ɠa ɗa kotoi ma mɔinmɔin gaazu maalɔɔɠu. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>À ɓɔɠɔ laazuʋɛ wo ɠilagilagi, naa mina ɠɛ ga unsuyeli vaa.<verse eid="1PE 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Wo ɠilagilagiti, à botii ɠɛ ga vebɛanii naa zɔiti bɛ, nii wo sɔlɔɔgai GALA zea. Naazu wa ɠɛɛzu ga GALA ná-vebɛaniiti ma ɠaliva ma nu ʋagɔiti. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Zɔi é tɛnɛgi wosu, é GALA daawooi ɓɔɠɔi nɔ wo. Zɔi é botii ɠɛɛzu, é kɛ ga naama zɛbɛi nii GALA ge feai zea. Naa ɠa a kɛ, fai pɛ su lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ, Yesu Kilista maaʋele ma, nii nɔnɔ ga lɛbiyai ta zobogi, eyɛsu ɠɔ. Amina!<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">È ɓɔlɔ tɔɔzei GALA fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, wo laa mina vɔ ga suɠɔɠɔ abui é zeizu wo ma, é ʋa ɠɛ eɠɛ faa niinɛ ɠa é zeizu wo ma. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Tɔun à ɠoozunɛ gola ga wa wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔna Kilista ná-kpɔlɔiti su, naa ɠa a kɛ wo-yiimaʋɛ laave ga koozunɛɛi, siɛgi zu ná-lɛbiyai ɠulazu la kɛlɛma. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Ni nuiti ta wo zopele ɲɔuzu tɔɔzei wa ga Kilista ná-nuiti, undaanɛ nu ɠa ga woye, mazɔlɔɔ lɛbiya Yɛnvui, GALA Zɛnvui ɠa wo ʋa. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Wo tanɔpɛ ge mina kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔ tɔɔzei toɠa ga nu ʋaa nu, ɓaa unma nu, ɓaa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu, ɓaa teʋezɔɠɔzu nu. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Kɛlɛ ni ta a ɓɔlɔna tɔɔzei toɠa ga keletiɛn, é mina unfe ga naa, tɔun é GALA dɛbi ga Kilista laasei pagɔi ʋɛa ba. <verse eid="1PE 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Siɛgi zeelia ga tukpɔɠaaleʋei tɔɔzei, GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti ka tɔɔzeizu ti ʋa. Tama ni tukpɔɠaaleʋei lɔɔ ɠa zeizu ade ʋa, zɔiti ti ɠɛlɛzu ga ti mina ɠidaaleʋe GALA ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma, naati gaaɓelazuʋɛ ɠa ɠɛ ɠale?<verse eid="1PE 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>«Ni telebo nui ɠizo fai a ɓaana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">GALA gaazuluabalala nui ta kotoba nui, tɔnɔi ɠa ɠɛ ɠale?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">TFa 11:31</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔiti ti kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔsu GALA ziimai maaʋele ma, ti maanɛɛʋɛ ti ɠili faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai ʋa, ti ɓɔɠɔ yɛ Kpɛtɛ ƓALAGI yeezu, é ga wooɠɛɠila nui ná-minazeɠegiti su.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-baala kpulugi makɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Nà totuɠɔiti tɛnɛsu, ti wo zaama. Nà ga totuɠɔ ga ti ɠɛʋele. Kpɔlɔiti ti zeini Kilista ma, nà ga naama zeelei ta. Nà nɔ̀nɔ zɔlɔɔ naama lɛbiyai zu, é ʋaazu ɠulazu kɛlɛma. Wɛlɛ nii ɠa gè bosu ti ma: <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>À GALA ná-baala kpulugi zɛsɛbo, nii kalivaai wo ma, wo ɠaaɓa ma ga pagɔ. À mina kɛ ga ɓala ʋele, kɛlɛ à kɛ ga ɠoozunɛ ʋele, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge pɔ la. À mina kɛ naavolo zɔlɔɔ faa ma, kɛlɛ à kɛ ɠi pagɔlai zu. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Niiti ti ɠalivaai wo ma, à mina zei ti unda ga maaɓa, kɛlɛ à ɠɛ ga poo pagɔ baala kpulugi ʋɛ. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Siɛgi zu baala makɛ ɠundiɠi wolai ɠulazu la kɛlɛma, wa masa bɔɔlɔgi zɔlɔɔ, é ga lɛbiya gelei, ná-foloi la ɠulaa ba pɛ.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɔɠɔmaayeii ta to kpaangi kidaaleʋei zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Zekana nɔ é la, nu niinɛiti, à ɓɔɠɔmaayei wo-yeemaazuiti bɛ. Wo pɛ, wa-ɓɔfaamaiti su, à ɓɔɠɔmaayeii loo ɠɔba eɠɛ seɠei, mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ ga: «GALA ka waso nuiti sakpe, kɛlɛ toɠa ná-zaalai la ɓɔɠɔmaayei nuiti ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">TFa 3:34</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>À ɓɔɠɔmaayei deɠɛmu, GALA zeei ná-zobogi wu, naa ɠa a kɛ é wo wuzeɠe, yeeɠɛɠalai zu é deveai. <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>À wa-yiizoolɛ vaiti pɛ da tɔun unma, mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é ɠaaɓaazu wo ma.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>À ɠɛ ga sɔɓelama nuiti. À dama. Wo zili nui é ga Inɛgi, toɠa leʋesu eɠɛ zalai nii é zikɔzu, é ɗa nu ɠaiziɛ, é ʋa mi. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>À lo kpaan kidaaleʋei zu, wo sakpe, mazɔlɔɔ wo-ɠɛɛleaiti ti eteai zu ná pɛ, ta naa ɠɛɠala ɓɔlɔi zɔlɔɔsu. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Wo kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma yeeɠɛɠala go laawu, GALA é ga zaalai pɛ Maliɠii, é wo loligai ga wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ná-ɠɔoɠɔ lɛbiyai zu, wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Yesu Kilista, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa wo ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, é wo zapelɔ, é wo zɛbɛlɔ, é wo ɠɔɠɔlo kpaan ɲiikpitalai zu. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Toɠa nɔnɔ ga zobogi, eyɛsu ɠɔ! Amina!<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Ade-ɠɛɛloin Silase, gè devezu ga wooɠɛɠila nui, naa ɠa kpɔgai bà, gè woo zuɓuɠa koi nii zɛʋɛ wo ma, gè wo lɛnɛ, gè maaɓakpa, ga pele ɠana GALA ná-zaala ɠitei la, nii wo ɠiliai ba.<verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Egilisii é Ɓaɓilɔne, GALA ge yiimazeɠeai la ga wo ɠɛʋele, naa ɠa wo luʋɔsu, dòun zunui Maleke ɓalaagi ɠa wo luʋɔsu. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>À ɓɔɠɔ luʋɔ ga nɛɛnɛi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Ziilɛigi ɠɛ wo pɛ wo ya, wɔiti wo ga Kilista nɔnɔiti.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
